# Side track J, step 5 (layer 4): the Game Boy boot splash, then the menu
# as the PS app opens it after an input (platform/ps/splash.zig, relay.zig):
# the demo runs from reset (make resim ROM=, standing in for the PS app's
# load), about 2 s of it (the logo is up by then), then the menu's rows
# and the control write that pauses the core and shows the overlay over
# the splash. make ci-demos compares frame 115 (the splash) and frame 125
# (the menu) with demos/golden/splash-<system>/. Format:
# Platform.Sim.Overlay.
wait 2000000
bar 0 1 ROM menu - Game Boy
text 1 1 /gb
bar 3 2 rota/
text 28 1 (boot splash; a key opened the menu)
bar 29 1 U/D move  R/C open  L back
# overlay on, game paused
ctrl 3
